    "title": "White House: Trump and Zelensky dispute reflect discontent with the contacts with Kyiv",
    "text": "The strong conflicts among US and Ukrainian leaders Donald Trump and Vladimir Zelensky reflect the dissatisfaction of Washington with the contact with Kiev, including the press secretary of the US government Caroline Livitt. According to her, though, Ukraine's president announced a statement, “which we consider a positive step forward.” In addition, assistant US President Mike Waltz contacted his Ukrainian colleagues. Earlier, Zelensky announced the group's first plan for the world with Russia, according to Telegram, Podotochka NSN NSN Radio.",
